    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Update! 5 new free dance tracks have been added! Also, a new mode has been introduced where the lead dancer faces the players while dancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance Eden is a VR/MR dance game where you can dance alone or with other players, following the lead dancer in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc83 A variety of dance styles\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >55 free dance tracks are provided, with different styles, and each song comes in two difficulty levels\u2014Regular and Hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Immersive music and dance environments\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance practice rooms, stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Multiple dance modes\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to have the lead dancer face you while dancing together, or have them face away from you, dancing towards a mirror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Personalized outfits\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a vast array of carefully crafted clothing and makeup options for you to combine and match, allowing you to fully express your individual charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/30fc9b13e8427001dc889184f1c2e877.poster.avif?t=1742960920\" width=724 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/30fc9b13e8427001dc889184f1c2e877.webm?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/30fc9b13e8427001dc889184f1c2e877.mp4?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/94bbc2dbf23cf2e02a4ed4e9bdc677cf.poster.avif?t=1742960920\" width=724 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/94bbc2dbf23cf2e02a4ed4e9bdc677cf.webm?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/94bbc2dbf23cf2e02a4ed4e9bdc677cf.mp4?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/03bb18fbdbba4b1de2b04a1c1b8566d6.poster.avif?t=1742960920\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/03bb18fbdbba4b1de2b04a1c1b8566d6.webm?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/03bb18fbdbba4b1de2b04a1c1b8566d6.mp4?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/9045cfb89b1866a04a4b697e0154c3d8.poster.avif?t=1742960920\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/9045cfb89b1866a04a4b697e0154c3d8.webm?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/9045cfb89b1866a04a4b697e0154c3d8.mp4?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will highly value your gaming experience and actively collect your feedback and suggestions to continuously improve the game content and user experience. Your participation is invaluable to us! You can give feedback in the 'bugs-suggestions' channel on our Discord!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Update! 5 new free dance tracks have been added! Also, a new mode has been introduced where the lead dancer faces the players while dancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance Eden is a VR/MR dance game where you can dance alone or with other players, following the lead dancer in real-time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc83 A variety of dance styles\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >55 free dance tracks are provided, with different styles, and each song comes in two difficulty levels\u2014Regular and Hard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfb5 Immersive music and dance environments\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance practice rooms, stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Multiple dance modes\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to have the lead dancer face you while dancing together, or have them face away from you, dancing towards a mirror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Personalized outfits\uff1a</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a vast array of carefully crafted clothing and makeup options for you to combine and match, allowing you to fully express your individual charm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/30fc9b13e8427001dc889184f1c2e877.poster.avif?t=1742960920\" width=724 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/30fc9b13e8427001dc889184f1c2e877.webm?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/30fc9b13e8427001dc889184f1c2e877.mp4?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/94bbc2dbf23cf2e02a4ed4e9bdc677cf.poster.avif?t=1742960920\" width=724 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/94bbc2dbf23cf2e02a4ed4e9bdc677cf.webm?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/94bbc2dbf23cf2e02a4ed4e9bdc677cf.mp4?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/03bb18fbdbba4b1de2b04a1c1b8566d6.poster.avif?t=1742960920\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/03bb18fbdbba4b1de2b04a1c1b8566d6.webm?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/03bb18fbdbba4b1de2b04a1c1b8566d6.mp4?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/9045cfb89b1866a04a4b697e0154c3d8.poster.avif?t=1742960920\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/9045cfb89b1866a04a4b697e0154c3d8.webm?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2934620/extras/9045cfb89b1866a04a4b697e0154c3d8.mp4?t=1742960920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will highly value your gaming experience and actively collect your feedback and suggestions to continuously improve the game content and user experience. Your participation is invaluable to us! You can give feedback in the 'bugs-suggestions' channel on our Discord!</p>",
